<GameData>
	<Language_en_US>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_SACREDRUINS_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Ancient Ruins</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_SACREDRUINS_HELP">
			<Text>There are some ruins around here. The settlers believe these ruins have some cultural origins about the previous inhabitants, but the ruins here contain precious metals we need to build up our infrastructure. What do you suppose we do?</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_SACREDRUINS_CHOICE_1">
			<Text>Preserve these ruins.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_SACREDRUINS_CHOICE_2">
			<Text>Maybe we can preserve some of the important writings and salvage the rest of it.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_SACREDRUINS_CHOICE_3">
			<Text>Important minerals are better than some crummy scratches.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_SACREDRUINS_CHOICE_1_HELP">
			<Text>[ICON_BULLET][COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]+1 [ICON_CULTURE] Culture in the City.[ENDCOLOR][NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET][COLOR_RESEARCH_STORED]+3 [ICON_FLOWER] Morality[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_SACREDRUINS_CHOICE_2_HELP">
			<Text>[ICON_BULLET][COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]+15 [ICON_CULTURE] Culture and +15 [ICON_PRODUCTION] Production.[ENDCOLOR][NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET][COLOR_RESEARCH_STORED]25% for +1 [ICON_FLOWER] Morality[ENDCOLOR][NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]50% for [ICON_PEACE] Morality[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET][COLOR_WARNING_TEXT]25% for -1 [ICON_OCCUPIED] Morality[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_SACREDRUINS_CHOICE_3_HELP">
			<Text>[ICON_BULLET][COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]+2 [ICON_PRODUCTION] Production in the City.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET][COLOR_WARNING_TEXT]-3 [ICON_OCCUPIED] Morality[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
		</Row>	
	</Language_en_US>
